  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>β</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>γ</mi></math> are the roots of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the equation whose roots are <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1hzoT",
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>216</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
